  <p class="cap">Grounding research (60+ sources): <code>workspace/CARD_STYLES_RESEARCH_2026-07-01/02/03.md</code>. Every style here has a documented pattern behind it, adapted to our cream/flora/oxblood world (never dark fintech).</p>
